abstract: >-
  An MIT-licensed, zero-dependency, local-first epistemic audit and AI anti-sycophancy
  toolkit combining a transparent deterministic rubric (browser + Python stdlib CLI),
  transcript echo-mirroring detection, tailored steelman/falsification reset prompts,
  and optional local Ollama or bring-your-own-key deep adversarial audits.
